WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.525
Lab 2 moves to a test tenant with
fictional records, never production.

2
00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:08.857
You create the provisioning app, extend
its schema with Microsoft's sample,

3
00:00:08.857 --> 00:00:11.791
and give the sender one
upload permission through

4
00:00:11.791 --> 00:00:14.725
a managed identity or a
certificate, never a secret.

5
00:00:14.725 --> 00:00:17.063
Start the job with its safety nets on:

6
00:00:17.063 --> 00:00:21.037
the notification email and
accidental-deletion prevention.

7
00:00:21.037 --> 00:00:24.313
Then send five records and
get one accepted batch.

8
00:00:24.313 --> 00:00:27.512
The step people skip is
the next one: reconcile.

9
00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:31.937
Every person key in the manifest should
show up in the provisioning logs.

10
00:00:31.937 --> 00:00:33.220
Then back it all out.
